.TH PIXEL-TD 6 "2026" "pixel-td 0.04" "Games"
.SH NAME
pixel-td \- pixel-art tower defense with infinite waves and exponential numbers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pixel-td
[\fB\-\-fullscreen\fR] [\fB\-\-save\-dir\fR \fIDIR\fR] [\fB\-\-reset\-save\fR] [\fB\-\-seed\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build towers anywhere off the road, survive endless waves whose enemy count, health,
damage and gold rewards grow exponentially, then Ascend (prestige) for permanent bonuses.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-fullscreen
Start in fullscreen mode. F11 toggles fullscreen in game.
.TP
.BI \-\-save\-dir " DIR"
Store the save file in DIR instead of the default location.
.TP
.B \-\-reset\-save
Delete the existing save file before starting.
.TP
.BI \-\-seed " N"
Seed the random number generator.
.SH CONTROLS
1-7 select a tower category and Z X C V B a tower in it; left click places/selects; right click or Esc cancels; Space starts the next wave;
P pauses; +/- changes game speed (x1 to x64); G cycles auto-upgrade (off / priority / all); Q meteor; W time freeze; U upgrades the selected tower; Esc opens the menu.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/pixel-td/save.json
(default ~/.local/share/pixel-td/save.json) Progress, written atomically after every wave; a .bak copy is kept.
